-- Module: k8s_client.
-- Scope: the in-cluster API boundary (§8, §9.2). Verified TLS with the
-- service-account CA and an IP-SAN hostname check, token reload from disk,
-- get, list and patch on pods, get and list on Deployments and ReplicaSets, the
-- minimum namespaced Role, and the patch content types and preconditions the
-- write mode needs (§9.10).
-- Owner: spike S1 (ticket 14) drafts this module's spec-then-build pair; ticket
-- 22 amends it with what the write mode needs. Blocked on S1.

