open question "§9.2 Tokens: how often the projected service-account token is re-read, and what happens when the read fails (ticket 14)."
open question "§9.2 Verbs: the exact verbs on pods, deployments, replicasets and events the Role grants, to be confirmed by what the client uses (§8 RBAC, ticket 14)."
